#: badend2:badend2_E81EC2ED_7A6F_4E49_B697_9FCC7EC85082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 381f7213f8bc5dad892754f765440ef811112d55ccc9528300e43eeedc74e441
#. default-sha256: 226e0b5c1980378534f47769d31782cda0f0ecdb438c4963cd7bd20d7553bf76
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_E81EC2ED_7A6F_4E49_B697_9FCC7EC85082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫You⟪k:21⟫The Departed⟪k:22⟫ could not accept the Maid’s offer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Non potevi⟪k:21⟫Il Defunto non poteva⟪k:22⟫ accettare l’offerta della Domestica."

#: badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 359038446587fcb401fdc0b8c5c08b051e379f7e3d204760f68a1e918eabefc5
#. default-sha256: e98db59d0f5ed6e71535e5c479ae554fce2584bed7954d34197b5e7db22c5f10
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_33A5723D_E91F_4B4B_B3E7_29178B387314"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If what she said was true, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not give up on ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"search."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se quello che aveva detto era vero, non ⟪k:1⟫potevi⟪k:2⟫poteva⟪k:3⟫ rinunciare alla ⟪k:4⟫"
"Tua⟪k:5⟫propria⟪k:6⟫ ricerca."

#: badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dde086551efce58f6787ee715f81dc62ed4f926da04c696fa1fb6f19cf031051
#. default-sha256: d83f31618cc61b25eed135b5a4481effed3f94bd9bdf36c7eea89bd22cde9be7
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_80517542_50EF_4845_B1BE_3B78A8E57242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had spent years and years waiting to reunite with someone.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫His⟪k:8⟫ previous attempts may have been rife with mistakes,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Avevi⟪k:2⟫Aveva⟪k:3⟫ passato anni e anni ad aspettare di riunir⟪k:4⟫ti⟪k:5⟫si⟪k:6⟫ con "
"qualcuno.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I Tuoi⟪k:10⟫I suoi⟪k:11⟫ precedenti tentativi potevano anche essere stati "
"inefficaci,"

#: badend2:badend2_155BDA4C_4B1C_4162_82A2_B7C905A6F03B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7c4c215ed8eed4d56fccf03e16e339adbcf1afe2529a5c8f52803eb9479be18
#. default-sha256: 34f03bdf8303adb34568ac4c5943e4abe01064769839ee439c7faa2e538a9f45
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_155BDA4C_4B1C_4162_82A2_B7C905A6F03B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫he⟪k:3⟫ could not stop trying."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ma non potev⟪k:1⟫i⟪k:2⟫a⟪k:3⟫ smettere di provare."

#: badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d07e3c6783e808eafbd4f3bec5bb2a35ccfd70098f485e5d3313a4b5ded0f8b7
#. default-sha256: 9bf97939f7c32d197d8f0a3f7d7f09f0bbbd769b5b6db400fc9b1a64e41c872a
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_FC3E3AEE_F43B_4252_95DB_D3633CE93C81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Come, Master. ⟪k:3⟫Spend eternity with me in the mansion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫We will have "
"the most wonderful time together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Venga, Padrone. ⟪k:3⟫Trascorra l’eternità in questa villa insieme a me.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Vivremo dei momenti meravigliosi insieme."

#: badend2:badend2_5AAFDCC9_D8B2_A4C8_7B06_CF901FBEDD88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21417c7fc69dee10ded5f92f7d48b52eb6886516df98650f06e7eefb97db46b4
#. default-sha256: 13a715bf62c4c6894884dbdf1e7360fe8ffe28cc14a0431640535fb24088fb57
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_5AAFDCC9_D8B2_A4C8_7B06_CF901FBEDD88"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sweet tone of her voice.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Her cold fingers.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Her icy smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il tono dolce della sua voce.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le sue dita gelide.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il suo sorriso glaciale."

#: badend2:badend2_60B37471_CF71_4582_AC06_A3A0CD0EBC0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32ed599ebfaa999e166a4bc5c60279508cc070efc78b0ee36600e1454d3bf59c
#. default-sha256: e1c4895de6d6ba2566a60ef390faffa1be536e78ed1a33396612cfa40a40e75d
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_60B37471_CF71_4582_AC06_A3A0CD0EBC0D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫These were all terrifying now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Erano diventati terrificanti."

#: badend2:badend2_E920478E_380D_40E0_9D6F_C1D5F3F22207
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 999fa2a3df783142cc69f2a7022bf0dcd3cca2543372f44f31f2d5e177978606
#. default-sha256: d98b38ebe4818541f993ce28c7b345354b0fee093de21c7a0a78a8a60884e23c
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_E920478E_380D_40E0_9D6F_C1D5F3F22207"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had to escape."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dovevi⟪k:2⟫Il Defunto doveva⟪k:3⟫ scappare."

#: badend2:badend2_BEEAD61C_6656_4F1B_916B_4AB6BF25FD13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c868a3f51b95e0432be04e322237792be7e49c762504c9901989891f73f6f113
#. default-sha256: fcc851884d9ad9076598666bfc014da9be9417f8155e247a1c85e346cc94eb49
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_BEEAD61C_6656_4F1B_916B_4AB6BF25FD13"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had to break out of this darkness, make it outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dovevi⟪k:2⟫Doveva⟪k:3⟫ uscire da lì, e raggiungere l’esterno."

#: badend2:badend2_DCAE5A81_0F95_44CE_96DD_DCE8DF36E8FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89f43e0be06a2b7d48a91671f83655fb0e26e4ffa681be6063cce514614642b0
#. default-sha256: da114de52409d6ba6082765f48c29cde3d4bc549468d5c917a12fd75a5853bf8
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_DCAE5A81_0F95_44CE_96DD_DCE8DF36E8FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Master? ⟪k:3⟫What is the—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Padrone? ⟪k:3⟫C’è qualche—"

#: badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4963c2f3d701662dc7ce6d17c8036bbf6750da2f79aceee324213704fb40bad
#. default-sha256: 58a24f81a7b30ec06c91c2a030177457c3696a10c42a047127d0e01c053c80cb
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_7D4AC5A9_92B5_4EB0_8126_EE36DAD7F283"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫He⟪k:5⟫ brushed the Maid’s hand aside.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫As her eyes widened, "
"aghast, ⟪k:8⟫You⟪k:9⟫he⟪k:10⟫ fled from the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Scansasti⟪k:4⟫Il Defunto scansò⟪k:5⟫ via la mano della Domestica.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫E "
"mentre gli occhi della donna si spalancavano per lo sconcerto,⟪k:8⟫ fuggisti⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"fuggì⟪k:11⟫ dalla torre d’osservazione."

#: badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de7876d203c3483a0b1cf305fd7f3aff4fe02cecde6cfe69193875aabee3d095
#. default-sha256: 92148f7ce5eabf9d77c7906075ca5450705e1dd4196c0f68fc100a229ba5b644
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_A3A19873_9FF8_4F6D_ABA1_EB8E9A7EEE89"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Down and down the spiral staircase ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫he⟪k:5⟫ went, though not a whisper "
"of a footstep could be heard in the stone tower. ⟪k:6⟫The stairs seemed to go on forever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Continuasti⟪k:4⟫Continuò⟪k:5⟫ a scendere sempre più in fondo lungo la scala a "
"chiocciola, eppure nella torre di pietra non si riusciva a udire nemmeno lo scalpiccìo di un "
"passo.⟪k:6⟫ Le scale sembravano non finire mai."

#: badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5fa00b9c1cfff58cdb92abd5cc9dc1678eebe50bba4dd1ca6889daedee46fda
#. default-sha256: 87e4bc2eb1376822bd7a071f2768133517709c0ed119124a8cee9ab7b0144cfa
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_1971F44F_273D_4E0B_A285_3EB8D4B69B09"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Down and down and down and down..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Giù, giù, sempre più giù..."

#: badend2:badend2_71CD261B_E4FB_441E_A0DB_71E9AB756C0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 079c33f562f2ae1749be3d8291bbb416a8ee8f7b9b4c7e1bfa340879754be684
#. default-sha256: 7646a36afc713d4fee6587aff41b66bc7d9c3c75d3dd5beaf73389fb629b8af8
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_71CD261B_E4FB_441E_A0DB_71E9AB756C0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At long last, ⟪k:3⟫You⟪k:4⟫the Departed⟪k:5⟫ arrived at the bottom, dashing from "
"the next room without a passing glance at the angel in the stained-glass window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Finalmente, ⟪k:3⟫giungesti⟪k:4⟫il Defunto giunse⟪k:5⟫ alla fine, precipitando⟪k:6⟫"
"ti⟪k:7⟫si⟪k:8⟫ nella stanza seguente ignorando l’angelo della vetrata."

#: badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bfea4baccbdba53965168060cedf432d8cd41d209678edf92b3cbe911bc8a8b
#. default-sha256: 9dea595123bd70a6e5d58ed411d2590d2a55b1d60cde9e05a07ec93a5e4cb9e9
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_9452EA81_98F8_424E_9759_125A43BC5142"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫The Maid had shown ⟪k:9⟫You⟪k:10⟫him⟪k:11⟫ around "
"the mansion, so ⟪k:12⟫You⟪k:13⟫he⟪k:14⟫ knew its layout."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫La Domestica ⟪k:9⟫Ti⟪k:10⟫gli⟪k:11⟫ aveva mostrato "
"la villa, perciò conoscev⟪k:12⟫i⟪k:13⟫a⟪k:14⟫ la sua struttura."

#: badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06a6043a19e0abd1ba8d66c4316662f6120480231aab632d570eccda7dc08876
#. default-sha256: 0eaa80170c0c3a85572843e70470307e4c3543d8de3ba4e263482cc7286c9a62
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3B6AC469_BC72_4416_B5FE_CBF87F7C49E1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O forse..."

#: badend2:badend2_05B7D727_4E82_4E03_8069_3EAE9DB44E5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f97a2fbecd689d71bbf359b30805185c9542fe8a820671b16e66e58c4eae2660
#. default-sha256: 2fa14ee787c7c49e69926b1bb58fe67b7a7d3466b1ea91212fdcffe01ea7f235
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_05B7D727_4E82_4E03_8069_3EAE9DB44E5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ familiar with it even before arriving here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫la conoscev⟪k:1⟫i⟪k:2⟫a⟪k:3⟫ già da prima di arrivare lì."

#: badend2:badend2_4F168C13_B50C_4B17_9524_6828D432A5A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8d14c38909c73cfecb19d1818110321b4bf0a2b958aa4c2ee3a8c11654b4f3d
#. default-sha256: d6f99265028851f4293ffc3f43a7df70efc55d49f77150d3ffd7cca70cd9c597
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_4F168C13_B50C_4B17_9524_6828D432A5A5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A large door came into view. ⟪k:1⟫The exit was up ahead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ben presto apparve una grossa porta. ⟪k:1⟫L’uscita era poco più avanti."

#: badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb9024e24ea531d775f154c09886ffe9fa8489b3e78e42ba8c1c6d83865f53c9
#. default-sha256: 1c66ee7dc3c8ebcf0b65fbd7b238d8075062eb1b37396ab554fd5fe7cf32722f
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_2234A750_B2AD_4B18_BBF0_F8962C89636C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Padrone."

#: badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba7ecb3d1f78830941c0e1adcb782481bfbef87ac2b7f882b0ac65baddf7ff3a
#. default-sha256: 7a0dfdacbf07df6cc8b64eb457d6e5f2eef96fc14d54f1326991674d7ff43acd
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_3A6FE51F_0E31_4710_817A_7E3EDCC8F603"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the next moment, her voice seized ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ from behind.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"You⟪k:7⟫The Departed⟪k:8⟫ turned back, and there stood the Maid,⟪k:9⟫wearing the same smile."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma un attimo dopo, la voce di una donna sopraggiunse alle ⟪k:1⟫Tue spalle⟪k:2⟫sue "
"spalle⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ti voltasti⟪k:7⟫Il Defunto si voltò⟪k:8⟫, e lì c’era la Domestica, con "
"la stessa espressione di sempre."

#: badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c1fb900049a6a6252d180fb48b7e17d026b33aed525ba3fb50f6f495923edd8
#. default-sha256: 146fac1bfcc9da81ef5a1de19d4538145aecc97d6d9798e5ed29449cd9a15371
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_0D38A2CE_82CE_43BC_B3C8_0FC474C863BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Where do you think you are going, Master?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I told you, you mustn’t let go "
"of my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dove crede di andare, Padrone?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Gliel’ho detto, non deve lasciare la mia "
"mano."

#: badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 437904a77cffbd19f23211bc5ee01146e3decd95f4b47dfadec6d727da2a723f
#. default-sha256: 0a9b59c2d6d43347bb143306ddf189cc331cc5537f80f166db7757b643eed513
msgctxt "badend2:badend2_38309D2C_2E9B_4AC0_A323_3B24BC06066F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This mansion is quite large.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You could get lost if you go walking around "
"unaccompanied."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Questa villa è piuttosto grande.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Potrebbe perdersi, vagando senza un "
"accompagnatore."

